<title>USA: West Haven, Conn., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>West Haven, Conn., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $7 million of West Haven, Conn., general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.8339 percent.</p>
</text>
